OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and wet day, as a band 
OL,6,Fof rain slowly moves east, which may   
OL,7,Ffall as snow or freezing rain for a    
OL,8,Ftime over the Cheviot Hills. The rain  
OL,9,Fclears by the evening. Feeling rather  
OL,10,Fcold under the cloud.                  
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy but largely dry start  
OL,13,Fto the night, a few showers or         
OL,14,Foutbreaks of light rain may develop    
OL,15,Flater. Becoming increasingly windy     
OL,16,Falong the coast. Feeling cold, with    
OL,17,Ffrost forming.                         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
