OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CSaturday:FA band of heavy rain moves   
OL,6,Fin from the south affecting most areas 
OL,7,Fby late morning. Becoming very windy,  
OL,8,Fespecially over the hills and along    
OL,9,Fthe coast.                             
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FClear   
OL,12,Fstart to Sunday, blustery showers      
OL,13,Fdevelop later. Cloudy periods and      
OL,14,Fwindy on Monday, rain across the       
OL,15,FPennines. Grey and wet on Tuesday.     
OL,16,FTurning noticeably milder from Monday  
OL,17,Fonwards.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
